          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP510 Galt Park [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I hit the mall this afternoon before heading back home. I braved the typical winds to head across the street for the 3 nearby caps that are surprisingly close to each other and all easy finds. As one would expect, this cap is still impossible to miss (or read.) Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

