          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP510 Galt Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N49° 41.871 W112° 50.247&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hit the parking meter and then walked over to the cap. pristine and sitting in a sidewalk. Gets no better than that for an easy park and grab. We walked down the street after this to get the next one. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11th of the day.&lt;/p&gt;

